    "title": "Three tornadoes touched down in Allegan, Montcalm Counties, NWS confirms - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Katie Sergent ,\n9 hours ago ALLEGAN COUNTY, Mich. — Three tornadoes have been confirmed to have touched down in West Michigan during Tuesday night's storms. According to the National Weather Service, two tornadoes touched down in Allegan County: an EF-0 and an EF-1. Meteorologists say there was a non-continuous path of tornadic damage, which... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
